<Layer cascaded="1" queryable="0"><Name>ndfd.conus.sky.points</Name><Title>NDFD Forecast conus.sky.points</Title><Abstract>
This service provides weather forecasts from the National Digital Forecast Database.
Day 1-3 forecasts are updated every 30 minutes.  Day 4-7 forecasts are updated every 6 hours.
"vtit" dimension:  "Valid Time / Issuance Time".  This WMS endpoint requires only the 
Valid Time, in the format:  YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MI.  You will get the most recently issued forecast for 
that valid time.  See the GetCapabilities document for available valid times.  This service updates
immediately upon receiving new forecasts. 
